WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.104 --> 00:00:03.430
(upbeat rock music)

00:00:03.430 --> 00:00:05.110
- I've been told that there's no

00:00:05.110 --> 00:00:07.490
spot for a woman in this sport.

00:00:07.490 --> 00:00:10.040
I've been physically assaulted in the cage,

00:00:10.040 --> 00:00:13.140
but I didn't let any of that stop me.

00:00:13.140 --> 00:00:15.473
Sometimes the fight is
outside of the ring.

00:00:19.570 --> 00:00:21.010
I'm Swayze Valentine, and I'm the

00:00:21.010 --> 00:00:23.870
first and only cutwoman in MMA.

00:00:23.870 --> 00:00:26.170
What we do is we wrap the fighters hands

00:00:26.170 --> 00:00:29.540
before they fight and we take
care of them between rounds.

00:00:29.540 --> 00:00:31.290
If there's any bleeding, we stop it;

00:00:31.290 --> 00:00:34.100
if there's any swallowing, we take it away.

00:00:34.100 --> 00:00:36.550
Pretty much the cutman
motto is to give them

00:00:36.550 --> 00:00:38.607
that one round that they needed to win.

00:00:49.040 --> 00:00:52.640
I saw my first live MMA fight, and

00:00:52.640 --> 00:00:55.020
it was just such a cool experience, and I

00:00:55.020 --> 00:00:59.313
wanted to be a part of that
arena as much as I could.

00:01:01.280 --> 00:01:05.550
I talked to the promoter and
asked him what jobs there were.

00:01:05.550 --> 00:01:08.753
He told me that my option
was to be a ring girl.

00:01:09.890 --> 00:01:14.080
I had to wear the tiniest string bikini.

00:01:14.080 --> 00:01:16.020
It was super uncomfortable to be wearing

00:01:16.020 --> 00:01:19.250
that in front of all these people.

00:01:19.250 --> 00:01:21.803
That was not a fit for me.

00:01:24.210 --> 00:01:26.350
I saw the fighters getting
their hands wrapped,

00:01:26.350 --> 00:01:29.340
and I immediately got butterflies

00:01:29.340 --> 00:01:31.920
in my stomach and I knew that was what

00:01:31.920 --> 00:01:33.470
I was supposed to be a part of.

00:01:34.780 --> 00:01:38.050
I would drive sixty miles one way to gyms,

00:01:38.050 --> 00:01:40.030
and I would voluntarily sit there

00:01:40.030 --> 00:01:43.260
and wrap fighters hands for
their sparring sessions.

00:01:43.260 --> 00:01:46.040
Just the sacrifice of doing it for so long

00:01:46.040 --> 00:01:49.223
without getting any income out
of it was really, really hard.

00:01:50.330 --> 00:01:53.810
I was a single mother of two young boys

00:01:53.810 --> 00:01:55.800
and still trying to be a cutwoman.

00:01:59.850 --> 00:02:01.750
Wrapping hands is more than just

00:02:01.750 --> 00:02:04.180
putting gauze around a hand.

00:02:04.180 --> 00:02:07.200
If you do not wrap a
fighters hands correctly

00:02:07.200 --> 00:02:08.863
then their hands will break.

00:02:10.300 --> 00:02:11.950
You need to wrap hundreds and hundreds

00:02:11.950 --> 00:02:15.010
of hands to be considered great.

00:02:15.010 --> 00:02:16.230
I'd wrap my kids hands; I'd wrap

00:02:16.230 --> 00:02:18.480
my parents hands; I'd wrap my friend hands;

00:02:18.480 --> 00:02:23.230
I would wrap as many hands
as I could possibly find.

00:02:23.230 --> 00:02:28.230
It took me years to
feel like I got it down.

00:02:29.550 --> 00:02:31.540
My first paying gig was WSOF,

00:02:31.540 --> 00:02:34.080
World Series of Fighting in 2010.

00:02:34.080 --> 00:02:35.980
After four years of doing it for free.

00:02:37.040 --> 00:02:42.040
In 2014, I was added to
the roster of UFC cutmen.

00:02:43.860 --> 00:02:46.140
UFC is the Ultimate Fighting Championship.

00:02:46.140 --> 00:02:47.960
It is the most famous stage in the world.

00:02:47.960 --> 00:02:50.260
It's like the Olympics of MMA.

00:02:50.260 --> 00:02:53.000
And now I travel all over the world

00:02:53.000 --> 00:02:55.301
being a cutwoman for the UFC.

00:02:55.301 --> 00:02:56.134
Nice job!

00:03:02.910 --> 00:03:04.890
During my journey of being a cutwoman

00:03:04.890 --> 00:03:08.150
I had a lot of ups and downs.

00:03:08.150 --> 00:03:13.150
My kids are a huge
reason why I do all this.

00:03:13.180 --> 00:03:15.520
They can see me, you know, not giving up

00:03:15.520 --> 00:03:19.090
and in the end hitting my goal,

00:03:19.090 --> 00:03:22.110
and that's what carried me
through 10 years of it, you know?

00:03:22.110 --> 00:03:24.410
It's just that desire inside of like,

00:03:24.410 --> 00:03:25.793
just keep going, keep going.

00:03:28.490 --> 00:03:30.650
I understand what the fighter has

00:03:30.650 --> 00:03:32.993
to go through to get into the cage.

00:03:34.030 --> 00:03:36.480
We both had to fight to
get our spot in the ring.

